[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3484.069, "timestamp": "00:58:04", "text": "連結到平台，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3490.47, "timestamp": "00:58:10", "text": "例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3495.03, "timestamp": "00:58:15", "text": "Stream Labs、Stream"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3497.6, "timestamp": "00:58:17", "text": "Men 等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3509.43, "timestamp": "00:58:29", "text": "支援。他們可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3513.589, "timestamp": "00:58:33", "text": "哦，等等。我不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3515.75, "timestamp": "00:58:35", "text": "啊，我本來應該同時處理多項任務的，但是，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3518.39, "timestamp": "00:58:38", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3524.23, "timestamp": "00:58:44", "text": "唉，我的多工處理能力好像全沒了，對吧？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3526.47, "timestamp": "00:58:46", "text": "以前總是這樣做，就好像我應該像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3529.27, "timestamp": "00:58:49", "text": "正常直播那樣說話一樣。我本來應該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3531.829, "timestamp": "00:58:51", "text": "像平常一樣說話，同時在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3536.069, "timestamp": "00:58:56", "text": "後台玩遊戲或做其他事情。我以前也這麼做過"}]